    "zh": "从左到右五组：循环核心（config、lifecycle、goal-check）驱动，决策（decision、turn-gate）给出方向，闲逛（wander、goal-completion）兜底，守卫（behavior、stall-guard、target-observation）纠偏，最后 apply 下发、snapshot 回读；箭头是控制环的推进方向。",
    "en": "Left to right in five groups: the loop core (config, lifecycle, goal-check) drives, decisions (decision, turn-gate) pick a heading, wander (wander, goal-completion) is the fallback, guards (behavior, stall-guard, target-observation) correct it, and finally apply dispatches while snapshot reads back; arrows show the control loop advancing."
